# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. In production these are set
# with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (see the README) — never committed.

SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...
SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=...
SETUP_ADMIN_TOKEN=pick-any-strong-random-string
POSTHOG_API_KEY=phx_...
POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID=95813
POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.posthog.com

# Optional: only needed if you want the RAG "why" answers generated by a
# hosted model instead of the free Workers AI default. Leave unset to use
# Workers AI (no extra cost, lower quality) — see src/rag/generate.ts.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
